  "id": "psychic-blindness",
  "term": "psychic blindness",
  "definition": "Psychic blindness, in this historical usage, means a loss or reduction in understanding the visual form of words. It is described as a purely sensory kind of sensory aphasia and is treated as separate in principle from problems of sensation or speech production.",
